  "description": "A blazing-fast, lightweight object mapper for .NET 10+. Powered by compiled Expression Trees for near hand-written performance. Features include convention-based mapping, automatic flattening, recursive deep mapping for complex objects, LINQ projection, and seamless Dependency Injection support.",
