  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.4.0 Highlights:\n      - NEW: Introduced Deep Mapping! SimpleMapper now natively supports recursive mapping for nested complex objects and collections (lists within lists).\n      - NEW: Added bidirectional mapping support with .ReverseMap()! You can now map back and forth with a single line of code.\n      - Maintained full backward compatibility and blazing-fast performance with Expression Trees.",
